<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 14.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 14.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 14     July 11   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  281.270     276.110     247.020   13.87 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.520     309.500     306.830    0.88 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.780     157.155     158.970   -1.38 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.372	46.510	47.182   -1.72 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  474.200     468.680     419.180   13.13 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.260     139.580     141.685   -1.71 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.152	16.114	16.185   -0.20 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  246.560     242.580     212.430   16.07 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.861	 1.862	 1.888   -1.43 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.553	 1.558	 1.581   -1.77 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  190.515     189.905     183.135    4.03 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
